    <briefdescription>
<para>Cache eviction listener interface for Phase 3 cache→coordinator→storage integration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 BETA (Phase 3 Integration)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides callback interface for cache implementations to emit eviction signals to external consumers (e.g., AccessCoordinator). This enables:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Unified cache-storage tier management</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Demotion feedback hooks</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Storage promotion/demotion decision support</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>include/access_model/access_coordinator.h (EvictionListener base) </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/cache/ROADMAP.md Phase 3 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>docs/architecture/CACHE_STORAGE_INTEGRATION.md </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
